{
  "id": "Lyo.Email.SendGrid",
  "name": "Lyo.Email.SendGrid",
  "area": "Communication",
  "tagline": "Twilio SendGrid implementation of `Lyo.Email`. `SendGridEmailService` implements `IEmailService`.",
  "description": "Twilio SendGrid implementation of `Lyo.Email`. One `EmailRequest` becomes one `SendGridMessage` with one personalization holding every To, Cc, and Bcc. `AddSendGridEmailServiceFromConfiguration` binds the `SendGridEmailOptions` section. A 2xx response is success. Non-2xx, including 429, is a failed `EmailResult` with no retry.",
  "features": [
    "**SendGrid.** One API call per message through `ISendGridClient`.",
    "**Recipients.** Display names are sent. Recipients on one personalization can see each other.",
    "**Attachments.** Base64, with filename, content type, and disposition `attachment`. `MetadataJson` is not sent.",
    "**Reply-to.** One address uses `reply_to`. Several use `reply_to_list` only.",
    "**Tracking.** Click, open, and subscription tracking are turned off on each message.",
    "**Priority.** `NonUrgent` and `Urgent` set the `Priority` header to `non-urgent` and `urgent`. `Normal` leaves that header unset, matching MailKit.",
    "**Message id.** `X-Message-Id` may be missing on a 202. The result is still success.",
    "**Probe.** `TestConnectionAsync` calls `GET scopes`.",
    "**Bulk.** The base fans out one API call per message, bounded by `BulkEmailConcurrencyLimit`.",
    "**DI.** `AddSendGridEmailService`, the options instance overload, and `AddSendGridEmailServiceFromConfiguration`. One singleton `SendGridClient` is shared.",
    "**Secrets.** `ToString()` omits the API key."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Set SendGrid options",
      "language": "json",
      "code": "{\n  \"SendGridEmailOptions\": {\n    \"ApiKey\": \"your_api_key\",\n    \"DefaultFromAddress\": \"noreply@example.com\",\n    \"DefaultFromName\": \"My Application\",\n    \"EnableMetrics\": false\n  }\n}"
    },
    {
      "title": "Register from config",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddSendGridEmailServiceFromConfiguration(configuration);"
    },
    {
      "title": "Register via a callback",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddSendGridEmailService(options =>\n{\n    options.ApiKey = \"your_api_key\";\n    options.DefaultFromAddress = \"noreply@example.com\";\n    options.DefaultFromName = \"My Application\";\n});"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "HTTP results",
      "body": "`ProviderResponse` is the status code plus the response body. A missing body is allowed. The base does not require a subject or a body. SendGrid's 400 comes back as a failed result."
    }
  ],
